<section class="sn-care-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="sn-eyebrow">Plant care</p><h1>Right plant.<br>Right conditions.</h1><p>A practical care system should connect every plant to light, water, potting, climate and aftercare guidance.</p></div></section>
<section class="sn-section"><div class="shell"><div class="sn-section-head"><div><p class="sn-eyebrow sn-green">Care essentials</p><h2>Start with the basics.</h2></div><p class="sn-head-copy">The theme mirrors the compact editorial-card rhythm of the reference while keeping the content specific to Sanjay Nursery.</p></div><div class="sn-care-grid"><?php $care=[['Light','Match each plant to bright indirect, filtered, low-light or full-sun conditions.'],['Water','Use plant-specific watering guidance instead of a fixed weekly schedule.'],['Potting','Record pot size, drainage needs, growing media and sensible repotting windows.'],['Climate','Surface seasonal heat and humidity context for Indian growing conditions.'],['Feeding','Keep fertiliser type, dilution and frequency explicit and safe.'],['Aftercare','Add acclimatisation and first-week care instructions for newly moved plants.']];foreach($care as $i=>$c):?><article class="sn-care-card reveal"><div class="sn-care-v v<?=($i%4)+1?>"><span><?=sprintf('%02d',$i+1)?></span></div><small>Care principle</small><h3><?=e($c[0])?></h3><p><?=e($c[1])?></p></article><?php endforeach;?></div></div></section>
<section class="sn-section sn-deep"><div class="shell sn-guide-band"><div><p class="sn-eyebrow">Data policy</p><h2>Care guidance should be species-specific.</h2></div><div><p>No generic care claims are inserted into product records. When inventory is imported, care attributes should come from verified nursery data so customers receive useful guidance rather than decorative copy.</p></div></div></section>
